## Reference Commands (Beacon / equivalent)

These are illustrative — adapt to current tradecraft and EDR posture. Many built-in commands are signatured; prefer BOFs.

| Need | Quiet option |
|---|---|
| Domain enum | SOAPHound, ADExplorer snapshot, `ldapsearch` BOF |
| Local PE check | Seatbelt BOF (`AllChecks`) over PowerShell PrivescCheck |
| Kerberoast | Rubeus BOF (`kerberoast /nowrap`) |
| AS-REProast | Rubeus BOF (`asreproast /nowrap`) |
| LSASS dump | nanodump BOF with `--silent` |
| File search on share | SnaffPoint or Snaffler (off-host or in-memory) |
| Cert template enum | Certipy `find -vulnerable -dc-ip <DC>` (off-host) |
| Coerce + relay | PetitPotam / DFSCoerce → ntlmrelayx (off-host) |
| Token manipulation | Rubeus, `make_token`, `steal_token` |
| Lateral exec | `jump psexec_psh` → switch to `jump winrm` if SMB heavy |

